 "purpose": "Held out. Nothing in this directory was consulted while designing a predicate, and the figures it produces are this package's only estimate of how it does on geometry it was not shaped by. Scoring it is allowed; fitting to it is not -- a set you have tuned against has stopped being held out, and recovering that costs a fresh draw.",
